<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Dear Future Sun-devil,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">A big congratulation on being admitted to Arizona State University, New College!&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">I would like to formally introduce myself, my name is Chris Kane and I am the Assistant Director to Recruitment at New College. I am reaching out to you today to give you some more information about New College and what makes us unique to other universities.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><b>The New College Experience</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">New College is located at the vibrant West campus. Our college is focused on a personalized learning experience that incorporates the complex and unique ways that different fields interact and affect one another with the goal of better preparing you for the future. Through unique resources only offered at New College, students are able to maximize their potential by receiving a small liberal arts education, while having all the resources of top-tier research university.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">At New College, we encourage intellectual curiosity and an interest in new ideas and discussion. This has led to increased undergraduate research opportunities for students in all degree areas. With a state-of-the-art education and the access to research as an undergraduate, students like yourself are able to develop critical thinking skills that make you stand apart from your peers, and make you more marketable in today’s marketplace.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">As you move forward during this exciting time in your life, I sincerely hope that you will consider New College as your future home. If you have any questions about New College, West campus, or one of our many unique programs, please contact our Recruitment Office through the information listed below. Thank you, and we’ll talk to you soon!&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">For more info on how to pay for college, please visit our <a href="https://newcollege.asu.edu/college-scholarships">scholarships</a> page.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">To schedule an advising appointment please call 602-543-3000</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Also just a friendly reminder to sign up for <a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/orientation/freshman/register-for-orientation">orientation</a> and pay your deposit if you haven't already done so. Space is limited!</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Kindest Regards,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">New College Recruitment Team&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">New College of Interdisciplinary Arts and Sciences&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><font color="#990000">Arizona State University, West campus</font>&nbsp;</font></div><div><a href="mailto:asknewcollege@asu.edu">asknewcollege@asu.edu</a></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">602-543-2890</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#ffffff">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></span></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>